{"id":"9cb4d4b688d02395","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LOccRow.md","title":"LOccRow","display":"LOccRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"LOccRow","parameters":["z940","z941","z942"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"LOccRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z940</span><span>z941</span><span>z942</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：指标替换与规约。有序参数：<code>z940</code>、<code>z941</code>、<code>z942</code>。</p>\n<p>指标 c 的自由出现；进入绑定时寻找 c+1。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ LOccRow z940 z941 z942)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists c\n  (exists t\n    (and\n      (@ Pair c t z942)\n      (and\n        (@ Nat c)\n        (and\n          (@ AnyRaw t)\n          (or\n            (@ TVar c t)\n            (or\n              (exists z946\n                (exists z949\n                  (and\n                    (@ ULam z946 t)\n                    (and\n                      (@ Succ c z949)\n                      (exists z950 (exists z951 (and (in z950 z941) (and (@ App z940 z950 z951) (@ Pair z949 z946 z951)))))))))\n              (or\n                (exists z945\n                  (exists z946\n                    (exists z949\n                      (and\n                        (@ TLam z945 z946 t)\n                        (and\n                          (@ Succ c z949)\n                          (exists z952 (exists z953 (and (in z952 z941) (and (@ App z940 z952 z953) (@ Pair z949 z946 z953))))))))))\n                (exists z947\n                  (exists z948\n                    (and\n                      (@ TApp z947 z948 t)\n                      (or\n                        (exists z954 (exists z955 (and (in z954 z941) (and (@ App z940 z954 z955) (@ Pair c z947 z955)))))\n                        (exists z956 (exists z957 (and (in z956 z941) (and (@ App z940 z956 z957) (@ Pair c z948 z957)))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"487e9a7343d4d692\" href=\"?note=487e9a7343d4d692\" title=\"ZFC_AnyRaw\">AnyRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" href=\"?note=59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" title=\"ZFC_TLam\">TLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f077e9016ad9f66b\" href=\"?note=f077e9016ad9f66b\" title=\"ZFC_ULam\">ULam</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_l